		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead, skeletal whale. Eyes are glinting red cavities. Surrounded by a miasma of undead sea birds, fish, and unclean things</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +8 (4d6), <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Capsize</strong>. Opposed STR versus captain's INT or ship is capsized and begins to sink.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead Parasites</strong>. Creatures within near of bakekujira at start of turn CON 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
